label "Agent-graph optimization diagram"
box space 10 96 116 60 "workflow space|(nodes, prompts,|edges)"
box opt 160 96 110 60 "optimizer|proposes graph" acc
box eval 320 40 120 50 "evaluator"
box best 320 150 120 50 "best graph|found"
arrow space opt
arrow opt eval
arrow eval opt dashed via=215,65
arrow opt best
note "prompts and edges can both be searched once an evaluator exists"
